<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss govt bond issue totals 561 mln Sfrs.</title>
<headline>Swiss govt bond issue totals 561 mln Sfrs.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss Federal Treasury said it has allocated 561 million Swiss francs in a new federal government bond issue maturing August 7, 2010.</p>
<p>The issue was priced at 97.65 to yield 3.731 percent.</p>
<p>Bids totaled 1.041 billion francs. The Treasury will also keep a further 200 million Swiss francs as its own tranche.</p>
<p>Settlement is on August 7, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
